Build Native Android & iOS Versions of QGuard Messaging
Objective

Design, build, and productionize native-quality Android and iOS versions of the QGuard Messaging application so users can securely install and use the application on their mobile devices.

The mobile applications must provide the same security posture, user experience, and post-quantum capabilities as the desktop application while following Android and Apple platform best practices.

The final applications must be suitable for deployment to:

Google Play Store
Apple App Store
