Success Criteria

The project will be considered complete only when:

✅ Android application builds successfully.
✅ iOS application builds successfully.
✅ All desktop messaging features are available on mobile.
✅ Quantum Vault is fully functional.
✅ All Post-Quantum Cryptography features are implemented.
✅ Subscription flow is operational.
✅ PayPal subscription integration is functional.
✅ Mobile UI is polished, responsive, and enterprise-grade.
✅ Applications meet Google Play and Apple App Store submission requirements.
✅ No placeholder implementations remain.
✅ The solution is fully production-ready and suitable for customer deployment.

Note: For distribution through the Google Play Store and Apple App Store, it is generally recommended to use each platform's native in-app subscription system (Google Play Billing and Apple In-App Purchases) for digital subscriptions, as this is required by their current policies in most cases. If you also support PayPal, it should be architected in a way that complies with each store's review guidelines. This will maximize the likelihood of successful app approval while maintaining a consistent subscription experience.